WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.736 --> 00:00:05.605
♪ ♪

00:00:05.607 --> 00:00:05.839
♪ ♪

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.240
&gt;&gt; Greg: YOU’VE SEEN THE VIDEO

00:00:07.241 --> 00:00:09.621
OF THE CENTRAL PARK LADY WHO

00:00:09.623 --> 00:00:11.785
WHEN ASKED BY A BIRD WATCHER TO

00:00:11.786 --> 00:00:12.866
LEASH HER DOG, CALLED THE COPS

00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:13.969
ON HIM.

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:15.383
&gt;&gt; THERE IS AN AFRICAN-AMERICAN

00:00:15.385 --> 00:00:17.580
MAN THREATENING MY LIFE.

00:00:17.614 --> 00:00:20.103
&gt;&gt; TELL THEM WHATEVER YOU LIKE.

00:00:20.104 --> 00:00:21.817
&gt;&gt; THERE IS AN AFRICAN-AMERICAN

00:00:21.851 --> 00:00:22.252
MAN.

00:00:22.253 --> 00:00:26.859
HE IS RECORDING ME AND

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.168
THREATENING MYSELF AND MY DOG.

00:00:29.169 --> 00:00:30.523
I’M SORRY.

00:00:30.558 --> 00:00:32.451
I CAN’T HEAR.

00:00:32.486 --> 00:00:35.239
I HAVE BEING THREATENED BY A MAN

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:35.671
MAN!

00:00:35.705 --> 00:00:37.107
PLEASE COME IMMEDIATELY!

00:00:37.142 --> 00:00:39.696
&gt;&gt; Greg: THAT POOR DOG.

00:00:39.697 --> 00:00:41.906
SHE SEEMS FIXATED BY RACE.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:44.454
IT SOUNDED LIKE SHE WAS USING IT

00:00:44.488 --> 00:00:46.499
TO GIN UP A FALSE ALLEGATION.

00:00:46.533 --> 00:00:47.765
ALONG WITH HORRIBLY MANHANDLING

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:50.330
HER POOR DOG, SHE BECAME THE

00:00:50.331 --> 00:00:52.407
PRIME EXAMPLE OF WHAT PEOPLE

00:00:52.408 --> 00:00:53.994
CALL A KAREN, PERSON GOOD TO

00:00:53.995 --> 00:00:55.282
COMPLAIN TO THE MANAGER, SOMEONE

00:00:55.284 --> 00:00:57.162
WHO MAKES A SCENE ABOUT NOTHING

00:00:57.163 --> 00:00:58.588
AND NOT MUCH OF A DOG OWNER.

00:00:58.590 --> 00:00:59.342
IT BACKFIRED.

00:00:59.343 --> 00:01:03.231
SHE LOST HER JOB AND HER DOG.

00:01:03.233 --> 00:01:06.803
IS THERE ANY SATISFACTION TO BE

00:01:06.804 --> 00:01:09.459
FOUND?

00:01:09.494 --> 00:01:10.297
MAYBE.

00:01:10.331 --> 00:01:12.017
HER MISTAKE ISN’T SMALL.

00:01:12.051 --> 00:01:14.247
IF IT HADN’T BEEN FILMED, THE

00:01:14.281 --> 00:01:15.458
BLACK MAN COULD HAVE BEEN

00:01:15.459 --> 00:01:15.671
ARRESTED.

00:01:15.672 --> 00:01:17.421
SHE COULD HAVE LIED SOME MORE

00:01:17.455 --> 00:01:18.526
AND SHOTS COULD HAVE BEEN FIRED.

00:01:18.561 --> 00:01:22.118
INSTEAD THE PHONE SAVED HIM AND

00:01:22.152 --> 00:01:23.085
RUINED HER.

00:01:23.119 --> 00:01:24.752
IS THIS DAMAGE PROPORTIONAL?

00:01:24.753 --> 00:01:27.421
SHE IS A JERK, ODDBALL, MAY BE A

00:01:27.422 --> 00:01:27.944
BIGOT.

00:01:27.945 --> 00:01:30.509
BUT SHE APOLOGIZED PROFUSELY.

00:01:30.511 --> 00:01:31.765
WHY NOT FORGIVE HER?

00:01:31.766 --> 00:01:32.892
BECAUSE THAT’S WHAT THE

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.479
BIRD WATCHER DID.

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:37.199
OF HER APOLOGY, HE SAID "IF IT’S

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:39.369
GENUINE AND IF SHE PLANS ON

00:01:39.403 --> 00:01:41.119
KEEPING HER DOG ON A LEASH GOING

00:01:41.153 --> 00:01:44.101
FORWARD, THEN WE HAVE NO ISSUES

00:01:44.102 --> 00:01:45.116
WITH EACH OTHER."

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:46.255
THAT’S NOT BAD.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:48.583
IF HE CAN DO IT, SO CAN YOU.

00:01:48.584 --> 00:01:50.869
IF YOU DON’T, THEN YOU’RE KIND

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:52.644
OF BEING A KAREN TOO, JUDGMENTAL

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:53.398
PERSON EMBRACING OUTRAGE BECAUSE

00:01:53.432 --> 00:01:54.582
IT FEELS GOOD.

00:01:54.583 --> 00:01:55.894
DON’T BE A BULLY.

00:01:55.895 --> 00:01:57.132
BE THE BIRD WATCHER.

00:01:57.134 --> 00:01:57.943
WE HAVE BAD DAYS.

00:01:57.944 --> 00:02:03.108
LUCKY FOR US A LOT OF THEM NEVER

00:02:03.142 --> 00:02:04.316
GET FILMED.

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:08.064
JESSE, EVERYBODY KNOWS A KAREN.

00:02:08.099 --> 00:02:10.999
SOMETIMES PEOPLE EVEN OUR

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:11.418
KARENS.

00:02:11.419 --> 00:02:12.908
ARE YOU A KAREN SOMETIMES?

00:02:12.942 --> 00:02:14.604
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I’M NOT GOING TO

00:02:14.638 --> 00:02:15.991
ANSWER THAT STUPID QUESTION.

00:02:16.025 --> 00:02:18.099
I WILL TELL YOU, I’M NOT CRAZY

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.550
ABOUT EITHER OF THESE PEOPLE.

00:02:20.551 --> 00:02:21.900
NUMBER ONE, THE GUYS A

00:02:21.934 --> 00:02:22.651
BIRD WATCHER.

00:02:22.652 --> 00:02:24.487
HOW MANY BIRD WATCHERS ARE IN

00:02:24.521 --> 00:02:25.365
PRISON RIGHT NOW?

00:02:25.366 --> 00:02:26.331
PROBABLY ZERO.

00:02:26.366 --> 00:02:27.940
THEY ARE THE MOST PEACEFUL

00:02:27.941 --> 00:02:28.841
PEOPLE IN THE WORLD.

00:02:28.875 --> 00:02:30.949
SHE DIDN’T NEED TO DO THAT.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:33.286
I GUESS SHE SHOULD NEVER PLAYED

00:02:33.288 --> 00:02:35.121
THE RACE CARD AND PLAYED 911.

00:02:35.122 --> 00:02:36.753
JUST LEASH YOUR DOG AND GET OUT

00:02:36.787 --> 00:02:37.677
OF THERE.

00:02:37.678 --> 00:02:40.257
BUT HE DIDN’T HAVE TO POSTED ON

00:02:40.291 --> 00:02:42.618
THE INTERNET AND RUIN HER LIFE.

00:02:42.652 --> 00:02:44.539
APPARENTLY HE WAS TRYING TO LURE

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:45.847
THE DOG WITH SCOOBY SNACKS TO

00:02:45.848 --> 00:02:47.437
TEACH HER A LESSON OR SOMETHING

00:02:47.438 --> 00:02:48.213
LIKE THAT.

00:02:48.247 --> 00:02:50.878
I THINK THEY SHOULD HAVE A BEER

00:02:50.879 --> 00:02:52.197
SUMMIT AND JUST SHUT UP ABOUT

00:02:52.198 --> 00:02:52.723
THIS.

00:02:52.724 --> 00:02:54.298
&gt;&gt; Greg: I DISAGREE.

00:02:54.299 --> 00:02:55.896
KATIE, I THINK HE DID THE RIGHT

00:02:55.898 --> 00:02:56.457
THING.

00:02:56.458 --> 00:02:58.087
HE HAD DEPOSED IT.

00:02:58.089 --> 00:03:00.554
SHE WAS GOING TO -- SHE COULD

00:03:00.555 --> 00:03:02.320
HAVE FRAMED HIM.

00:03:02.321 --> 00:03:04.631
ALSO HE KIND OF FORGAVE HER

00:03:04.632 --> 00:03:06.161
BECAUSE HE KNOWS HER LIFE IS

00:03:06.195 --> 00:03:07.172
GETTING RUINED.

00:03:07.207 --> 00:03:09.218
I’VE GOT TO GIVE HIM CREDIT.

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:11.118
&gt;&gt; Katie: WE SHOULD ALL BE

00:03:11.119 --> 00:03:12.035
MORE LIKE HIM.

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:13.168
I THINK HER BEHAVIOR WAS

00:03:13.202 --> 00:03:14.173
ABSOLUTELY DISGUSTING.

00:03:14.207 --> 00:03:16.119
SHE WAS THE ONE WHO WAS BREAKING

00:03:16.154 --> 00:03:16.825
THE RULES.

00:03:16.826 --> 00:03:18.578
IN GENERAL, I HATE WHEN PEOPLE

00:03:18.579 --> 00:03:20.275
WHO BREAK THE RULES AND THEN YOU

00:03:20.276 --> 00:03:22.117
SAY SOMETHING TO THEM AND THEN

00:03:22.118 --> 00:03:23.241
THEY ACT LIKE YOU ARE THE

00:03:23.276 --> 00:03:23.631
PROBLEM.

00:03:23.666 --> 00:03:24.823
THAT’S EXACTLY WHAT SHE DID

00:03:24.825 --> 00:03:25.345
HERE.

00:03:25.346 --> 00:03:27.254
SHE UPPED THE ANTE BY BEING

00:03:27.256 --> 00:03:28.759
RACIST ABOUT IT AND CALLING THE

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.662
POLICE, EVEN THOUGH SHE WAS THE

00:03:30.663 --> 00:03:32.676
ONE WHO WAS IN THE WRONG.

00:03:32.677 --> 00:03:34.014
IT WAS OBVIOUS BECAUSE THERE

00:03:34.015 --> 00:03:36.856
WERE SIGNS POSTED EVERYWHERE.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:39.344
SO IT’S UNFORTUNATE THAT SHE’S

00:03:39.379 --> 00:03:40.963
FACED CONSEQUENCES FOR THIS BUT

00:03:40.965 --> 00:03:42.210
HER BEHAVIOR IN THIS SITUATION

00:03:42.211 --> 00:03:43.682
AND AS YOU SAID, SHE COULD’VE

00:03:43.716 --> 00:03:45.325
SET A WHOLE LOT OF THINGS ABOUT

00:03:45.359 --> 00:03:46.472
WHAT WAS GOING ON.

00:03:46.473 --> 00:03:47.747
HE WASN’T THREATENING HER.

00:03:47.749 --> 00:03:50.114
HE WAS SAYING COULD YOU PUT YOUR

00:03:50.115 --> 00:03:52.139
DOG ON ON THE LEASH AND FOLLOW T

00:03:52.173 --> 00:03:52.347
RULES.

00:03:52.348 --> 00:03:53.219
&gt;&gt; Greg: HERE’S THE BIG

00:03:53.221 --> 00:03:54.851
QUESTION IN MY MIND.

00:03:54.852 --> 00:03:56.623
SHE DID AN AWFUL THING.

00:03:56.657 --> 00:04:00.603
SHE HAS LOST HER JOB AND HER DOG

00:04:00.604 --> 00:04:01.774
AND HER REPUTATION.

00:04:01.808 --> 00:04:04.673
IF SHE’S NOT GIVEN A SECOND

00:04:04.674 --> 00:04:06.036
CHANCE AFTER AN APOLOGY, THEN

00:04:06.038 --> 00:04:08.102
WHAT CAN SHE DO?

00:04:08.136 --> 00:04:11.226
AREN’T WE THERE TO GIVE SECOND

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:11.904
CHANCES?

00:04:11.939 --> 00:04:13.264
&gt;&gt; Donna: LOOK.

00:04:13.265 --> 00:04:14.915
I THINK MR. COOPER HAS BEEN

00:04:14.916 --> 00:04:15.998
QUITE GRACIOUS.

00:04:15.999 --> 00:04:21.574
HE REMINDED ME OF THE FOLKS WHO

00:04:21.575 --> 00:04:26.842
FORGAVE THE MAN AND A

00:04:26.844 --> 00:04:27.454
ORGANIZATION.

00:04:27.455 --> 00:04:28.833
YOU CAN FORGIVE.

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:29.502
IT’S WRITTEN.

00:04:29.537 --> 00:04:31.559
IT’S SOMETHING WE ALL BELIEVE,

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:33.488
AS MANY OF US WHO ARE CHRISTIAN,

00:04:33.523 --> 00:04:35.047
