00:04:43.367 --> 00:04:46.546
WHEN SHE CALLED 911 OH, MAYBE WE

00:04:46.581 --> 00:04:49.131
SHOULD REMIND HER THAT SO MANY

00:04:49.165 --> 00:04:51.029
AFRICAN-AMERICAN MEN AND WOMEN

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:53.806
