00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:56.100
SIMPLY BECAUSE THEY EXIST.

00:04:56.101 --> 00:04:57.392
I HOPE PEOPLE LEARN SOMETHING

00:04:57.426 --> 00:04:59.010
FROM THIS THAT WE ARE NOT

00:04:59.011 --> 00:05:00.339
TALKING ABOUT IT TWO OR THREE

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:02.235
DAYS FROM NOW AND NO, WE

00:05:02.269 --> 00:05:03.512
SHOULDN’T THREATEN HER LIFE AND

00:05:03.547 --> 00:05:05.743
NO, SHE SHOULD BE ABLE TO SAY

00:05:05.745 --> 00:05:08.764
I’M SORRY AND GET BACK TO WORK

00:05:08.765 --> 00:05:10.406
AT SOME POINT.

00:05:10.407 --> 00:05:12.445
&gt;&gt; Katie:&gt;&gt; Greg: DANA, HIS NAME

00:05:12.446 --> 00:05:12.731
CHRISTIAN.

00:05:12.766 --> 00:05:16.309
